   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y942a\"></div><figure><img src=\"symp/img/yb-9-4-2-f1.webp\" alt=\"Delirium algorithm: DSM-V criteria and causes\"><figcaption>Delirium (9.4.2) — DSM-V 2013 criteria → neurologic disorder (cerebrovascular, autoimmune, tumor, infection) / systemic disorder (medication-drug/toxin, electrolyte, endocrine, metabolic, sepsis, other)</figcaption></figure>"
