  {
   "op": "append",
   "sec": "dx-dsm5",
   "html": "<p><b>DSM-V 2013 criteria for delirium due to a general medical condition (เล่มเหลือง)</b></p><ol><li>Reduced ability to direct, focus, sustain, and shift attention</li><li>Change in cognition</li><li>Caused by consequences of general medical condition</li><li>Develops over a short period of time (hour - day)</li><li>Fluctuate in severity during the course of a day</li></ol>"
  }
